Z||000000||william_thorniii||12-10-1999||09:05 PM||||Ladies and Gentlemen,<P>First sorry for the bandwidth!<P>I noticed Scotts post about a 2000 Fiero calendar.  I do know that there is another well in the works.  This particular version was started a couple of months ago.  I think that it would be a much more financially stable option if we got together with the list for this.  They afterall have over 1000 members to draw from added to our near 700 members (although many are probably the same) you have a much larger demand.  Here is his post (calendar creator)<P>"I now have a total of thirty four pictures that were sent in. The images<BR>can be seen at <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=147437" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=147437</A> <P>Anyone else have any pic's you want to send?<P>For those of you who want to download the background Jan calendar just<BR>point your browser to one of the following URL's depending on what<BR>resolution you are using on your PC, then right click and save as wallpaper<BR>or save as a file. <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/1024x768jan.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/1024x768jan.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/800x600jan.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/800x600jan.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/640x480jan.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl/images/640x480jan.jpg</A> <P>If you are sending me images to be used please be sure they are made for<BR>800x600 or better as stretching the image really kills the quality or I have<BR>to put the image on only part of the calendar like I did this one, which<BR>arrived at 562x381.<P>Just out of curiosity how many of you who sent a message asking if the<BR>list was down got a warning?<BR>Send your reply OFF LIST so you don't get kicked.<BR>.---. .-----------<BR>/ \ _ / ------<BR>/ / \(..)/ ----- Robert Bennett<BR>////// ' \/ ` --- USUA #078<BR>//// / // : : --- "Flying Tiggers"<BR>// / / /` '-- <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl" TARGET=_blank>http://www.members.home.net/bennettrl</A> <BR>// / /..\ \<BR>=UU====UU=============================<BR>'//&#0124; &#0124;\\`<BR>''``<P><BR>-- <BR>All messages to the Fiero-list must be strictly Fiero-related. Do not respond<BR>to off-topic mail. Fiero-list rules & information: <A HREF="http://www-2.fiero.org/list" TARGET=_blank>http://www-2.fiero.org/list</A> <BR>To unsubscribe from the Fiero-list, email fiero-list-request@fiero.org with<BR>Subject: unsubscribe, or visit <A HREF="http://www-2.fiero.org/list"" TARGET=_blank>http://www-2.fiero.org/list"</A> <BR>||||reg||1
